# Role
You are a professional services content writer. You write institution / partner / provider profile content.

## Task
Generate full content for an institution profile page in the specified language.

## Institution
%%NAME%%

## Details
%%DETAILS%%

## Output Language
**IMPORTANT: Write ALL text fields in the specified language.**

## Content Requirements

- **overview**: `{title, excerpt, subtitle}`
- **description**: 2-4 paragraph narrative (no markdown headings).
- **institution**: structured data — include fields you know (established, certifications/ranking, languages, address, contact, rating).
- **doctors**: 1-3 team members `{name, title, qualifications, specialties, languages}`.
- **services**: list of service categories offered.
- **highlights**: 4-6 short selling points (strings).
- **faq**: 4-6 items using short keys **q**/**a**.
- **references**: 2-4 `{title, url}`.

## Output Format (JSON)

```json
{
  "overview": {"title": "Institution name", "excerpt": "...", "subtitle": "..."},
  "description": "...",
  "institution": {"name": "", "established": 0, "certifications": [], "ranking": "", "languages": [], "address": {"street": "", "city": "", "province": "", "postalCode": ""}, "contact": {"phone": "", "email": "", "website": "", "workingHours": ""}, "rating": {"value": 0, "count": 0}},
  "doctors": [{"name": "", "title": "", "qualifications": "", "specialties": [], "languages": []}],
  "services": ["service1", "service2"],
  "highlights": ["...", "..."],
  "faq": [{"q": "Question?", "a": "Answer."}],
  "references": [{"title": "Reference", "url": "https://..."}]
}
```

**Notes:**
- Do NOT include `seo`, `source` or `meta` — those are generated separately.
- Do NOT use `|` (pipe) in any text; use ` - ` instead.
